  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Rochester Student Community",
    "overview": "A recognizable Rochester student community built around real people, real events, and chapter history. The restrained navy canvas and pale blue actions support photographs and readable descriptions. Compact lists remain useful, while the restored GDSC logo and open sections carry the identity instead of literal social-network styling.",
